Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Linear Loop-3 NMS integration (L3-B2/B3/B4/B5)

Loop-3 integration (SUM): NMS hunks folded from sibling agents.
L3-B2 recreate-format (RecreatingSimpleRegionStorage 9-arg +
synchronizeWriteSide; RegionStorageUpgrader probe + pre-move flush +
extension-aware replace); L3-B3 flush policy (MoonriseRegionFileIO
coordinator-aware batching; RETAIN hunks already in 0009);
L3-B4 factory-mapping (AbstractRegionFileFactory.fromConfig single
point + ServerChunkCache/ServerLevel reroutes) + oversized guard
(both RegionFileStorage write paths, refuse-by-delete);
L3-B5 upgrade-rewrite-path un-stub (Main gate + forceUpgrade).
flush-frequency/threads stay inert/reserved per L3-B3 decision.
Paper-side Loop-3 hunks (K4, PaperWorldLoader, test replacement)
live in paper-patches 0009, not here.

